      <data key="d4">Global: DBT: Day 1 up to 14 weeks post last dose of blinded study drug (up to 131 weeks), OLE: Day 1 of OLE period up to 14 weeks post last OLE dose (up to 68 weeks); China DBT: Day 1 up to 14 weeks post last dose of blinded study drug (up to 124 weeks) All cause mortality: DBT: Day 1 up to the end of study (up to approximately 164 weeks); OLE period: From OLE Day 1 up to the end of the study (up to approximately 86 weeks)</data>
