      <data key="d1">Solanezumab</data>
      <data key="d10">EXPERIMENTAL</data>
      <data key="d11">Solanezumab 400 milligrams (mg) every 4 weeks for 76 weeks with an additional 4 weeks of assessments. Participants who complete the full 80 weeks of treatment/assessment and decide to continue will take this regimen for up to an additional 208 weeks.</data>
