      <data key="d91">2019</data>
      <data key="d57">Biogen / Eisai</data>
      <data key="d92">Early Alzheimer’s</data>
      <data key="d93">Phase III: both stopped for futility; fuller data later positive in EMERGE, negative in ENGAGE. Mixed/reversed case.</data>
      <data key="d94">U</data>
