      <data key="d106">["ADULT", "OLDER_ADULT"]</data>
      <data key="d107">Intention-to-Treat (ITT) populations for parts A, B, and C included all randomized participants who received at least 1 dose or a part of 1 dose of study treatment (BIIB067 or placebo) in Parts A, B, and C respectively. The demographics data reported for Part B arm groups included only the unique participants who were enrolled directly into Part B of the study.</data>
